ng time: 2.79 h</p></li><li><p>Memory used: 14.18 GB</p></li></ul><p>Moreov=
er, I found that the modeling performance was barely affected, which makes =
QLoRA a feasible alternative to regular LoRA training to work around the co=
mmon GPU memory bottleneck.</p><div class=3D"captioned-image-container"><fi=
